{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5366","title":"Introducing POCO M7, Big Battery, More Fun, All at an Affordable Price","desc":"POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today launched POCO M7. By combining elevated entertainment experience, upgraded performance, and futuristic design, POCO has crafted a smartphone that resonates with today's younger generatio","view_cnt":"10178","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1755157027","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/982_operatorx_operatorx_opx/14/08/2025/1daddc4aa01516bdfcc9dc49d23d45e7.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBeijing, China, August 15th, 2025 \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e– POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today launched POCO M7. By combining elevated entertainment experience, upgraded performance, and futuristic design, POCO has crafted a smartphone that resonates with today's younger generation.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\"POCO M7 blends affordable mobile entertainment with practical upgrades and all-day endurance,\" commented Kang Lou, Senior Product Marketing Manager at POCO Global. \"We believe that POCO M7 will serve as both a functional and emotional element, inspiring young users to explore more joyful lives.\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eLong-lasting battery life with faster, smarter charging\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eThanks to revolutionary 5% silicon-carbon battery technology, POCO M7's 7000mAh (typ) battery is built for non-stop lifestyles, powering up to 2 days¹ of daily usage. Its flagship-grade silicon carbon technology packs improved energy density into a compact design while delivering extended endurance with up to 28 hours¹ of video playback, or 46 hours¹ of calling. Enhanced by a BatteryExtender Chip, POCO M7 features 3.0V low-voltage shutdown², helping to prevent battery damage and provide optimal device performance, along with up to 14² hours of video playback even at -20°C². When power runs critically low, 1% battery still delivers 64 minutes² of call time, or 10 hours² of standby, ensuring you never miss what matters most.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/185_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/14/08/2025/66e6715c6d43d2c602581b3aac34cd9c.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePaired with 33W³ Fast Charging, POCO M7 offers 18W⁴ reverse charging, supporting other major devices on the market⁴. Meanwhile, Battery Health 4.0 intelligently adjusts the charging strategy to help provide smart charging solutions and extend the overall battery lifespan. For instance, Zero Power Instant On allows POCO M7 to power on within seconds after the battery is depleted. When the battery drops below 40%, Boost Charging saves users from power anxiety by safely removing temperature controls to deliver fast charging.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/653_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/14/08/2025/9f2d93cca321b3b731ed2effdb48d6d0.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBig screen entertainment with immersive 6.9'' FHD+ display\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFeaturing the largest-ever 6.9'' FHD+ display in POCO's M series, POCO M7 offers a wide-screen cinematic view ideal for on-the-go entertainment. Moreover, AdaptiveSync provides 9 levels⁵ of adaptive refresh rate adjustment, peaking at an impressively fast 144Hz⁵, allowing POCO M7 to deliver a seamless visual experience. To ensure long-term eye protection, POCO M7 is TÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Software Solution), TÜV Rheinland Flicker Free, and TÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly certified. POCO M7 delivers a high-quality audio experience with Hi-Res Audio certification and a 200% volume boost⁶, giving you greater audio clarity and control wherever you are.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/22_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/14/08/2025/2ee97fdb9f42297facf3df70453e37a5.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFuturistic design with upgraded performance and features\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO M7 is available in three colors and design options, each representing a bold fusion of technology and trendsetting style. Drawing inspiration from the classic look of superheroes, POCO M7 Silver highlights subtle blue and red accents around its frame, while POCO M7 Blue evokes a mecha-inspired sense of adventure. For those who prefer minimalist elegance, the sleek Black keeps things simple and stylish. All models come with IP64⁷ dust and water resistance.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/298_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/14/08/2025/ded4010ccf7b59ac9cfea2f5f4f99467.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO M7 is powered by the Snapdragon\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e®️\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e 685 processor for faster, smoother daily tasks. Beyond the hardware, POCO M7 runs on the latest Xiaomi HyperOS 2⁹ for improved performance and efficiency. POCO M7 also introduces Google Gemini AI assistant¹⁰ and Circle to Search with Google¹¹ to boost productivity and creativity. To meet users' growing demand, POCO M7 is equipped with up to 16GB¹² of expandable RAM (based on 8GB version), and up to 2TB¹³ of expanded on-device data storage.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/241_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/14/08/2025/f460f0affa2656ec2d70107c074e6f70.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFor photography, POCO M7 packs a rear 50MP dual camera system that captures sharp, detailed photos in all scenarios, and an 8MP front camera for clear selfies. Advanced features include Auto Night Mode, Selfie Beauty Mode, and Dynamic Shots¹⁴.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/808_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/14/08/2025/28496e85bcbe9152d49ec206a59f1d4f.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eProduct availability\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO M7 is available in three colors: Silver, Blue, and Black.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eIt will be available in two variants: 6GB+128GB, and 8GB+256GB.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Please consult the local seller on the availability of color, storage and RAM variant.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Price and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003emi.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹Data obtained from the light daily use model of POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e²Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e³Availability of in-box power adapter may vary by region. Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁴Supports up to 18W wired reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through POCO Internal Labs testing. Actual performance may vary depending on battery conditions and other factors. When using this feature, please ensure your phone has sufficient battery and verify the compatibility of the receiving device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁵Refresh rate can be adjusted to up to 144Hz for supported apps.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁶Data compared with POCO M6. Actual effects may vary due to software and scenarios. Please refer to the actual use.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁷The device with IP64 has been tested to be resistant to splash and dust in the presence of specific laboratory conditions with the classification IP64 ingress protection based on IEC 60529: 1989+A1:1999+A2:2013\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁸Data tested based on AnTuTu v10.5.1 by POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁹Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS 2 features, apps, and services may vary depending on region, software version and phone model.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹⁰Gemini mobile app available on select devices, languages, and countries. Works with compatible accounts. Internet connection required. Check responses for accuracy. Feature availability varies based on language. Gemini is a trademark of Google LLC.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹¹Available on selected devices and internet connection required. Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Results may vary depending on visual matches.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹²16GB RAM with Memory extension is based on 8GB RAM version. Additional RAM will occupy a corresponding amount of ROM storage. Memory extension is only available when there is enough storage space on your device. The actual extension of RAM storage capacity varies across different models.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹³microSD card for expandable storage sold separately, please refer to the actual use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹⁴Dynamic shots will be available via OTA and may not support sharing via third-party apps.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy – \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" – drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making to accelerate the company's evolution and refresh the smartphone industry.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"2138","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1755237455"},"common":null}